    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — OLD COMFYUI CANON-EDIT PLAN\n\nThis PR hard-binds the old SALVADOR v1 route to local ComfyUI + SD1.5 img2img and a `CANON_REFERENCE_EDIT` production mode. Fresh #251 now has one active product stream at `P01 PROJECT PLANNING`, with software intentionally unselected until the phase requires it, and the old source/editor/tool route retired as a global blocker.\n\nThe old plan must not remain an apparently live production candidate.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL`. Preserve design history; no production activation or canon authority is carried forward.",
